  "name" : "Strasen2018 - TGFb SMAD Signalling - Degradation of 25pM ligand (TGFb)",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>MOdel simulates 25pM ligand degradation kinetics as shown in Figure 4D</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
